WEBVTT

00:09:29.891 --> 00:09:32.318
the filmmakers don't make as many movies

00:09:32.342 --> 00:09:34.883
and the artists produce fewer paintings.

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:36.588
But those who stay productive,

00:09:36.612 --> 00:09:39.357
their hit rate was every bit as high
in their 50s and 60s

00:09:39.381 --> 00:09:41.334
as it was in their 20s and 30s.

00:09:41.358 --> 00:09:43.649
So, you know, I think
about Frank Lloyd Wright

00:09:43.673 --> 00:09:46.355
designing Fallingwater at 68 years old,

00:09:46.379 --> 00:09:48.649
his crowning architectural achievement.

00:09:48.673 --> 00:09:51.205
Or I'm sure you've come across
Raymond Davis Jr,

00:09:51.229 --> 00:09:53.742
the scientists who measured
neutrinos from the sun.

00:09:53.766 --> 00:09:56.563
He didn't build the key
detector until he was 51

00:09:56.587 --> 00:09:59.381
and kept running his experiments
until he was 88,

00:09:59.405 --> 00:10:01.476
the year he won the Nobel Prize.